# Build context allowlist. Without this, docker build ships the whole repo
# (.cloche/logs, .cloche/runs, .gitworktrees, examples/ — several GB).
#
# Consumers of the repo-root context:
#   docker/cloche-base/Dockerfile — Go sources for cloche-agent and clo
#   .cloche/Dockerfile            — credentials + setup script (also built by cloched)
*
!go.mod
!go.sum
!api/
!cmd/
!internal/
!.cloche/credentials/
!.cloche/setup-credentials.sh

**/node_modules
